				4
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Maintain, Mountain, Output, and Sky submodules\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Mountain (715198ac):\n   - Simplify binary and Tauri config naming from verbose development identifier back to \"Mountain\" for binary/lib names, Tauri identifier (\"land.editor.binary\"), and productName\n   - Remove duplicate externalBin entry and delete obsolete .Backup files\n\n2. Output (57d46b48):\n   - Add inline stub fallback for missing NLS files (nls.messages.js, nls.keys.json, nls.messages.json, nls.metadata.json)\n   - Use tier 4 fallback mechanism with data:text/javascript stubs to prevent webview 404s from falling through to SPA HTML and causing \"Unexpected token '<'\" JavaScript parse errors\n\n3. Sky (b62c0127):\n   - Fix NLS message loading: add stub nls.messages.js that seeds empty _VSCODE_NLS_MESSAGES array for fallback string behavior\n   - Fix NLS.astro to always load vs/nls.js regardless of dev/prod mode\n   - Fix Electron.astro worker script loading: use separate inline module script tags instead of collapsed async bundle to preserve document order guarantees\n\n4. Maintain (2a5f0378):\n   - Submodule sync to latest maintenance scripts\n\nImpact: Build configuration now uses clean \"Mountain\" naming. NLS loading is fixed across Output and Sky to prevent bootstrap failures. Worker scripts execute in correct order. All submodules updated to latest.",
